sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Frontend as React Frontend
    participant API as FastAPI Backend
    participant ImageSvc as Image Service
    participant PredSvc as Prediction Service
    participant Model as ML Model<br/>(Student/Teacher)
    participant ReportSvc as Report Service
    participant Storage as File Storage

    Note over User,Storage: Image Upload Flow
    User->>Frontend: Upload X-Ray Image
    Frontend->>Frontend: Validate file type<br/>(PNG, JPG, JPEG, DCM)
    Frontend->>API: POST /api/upload<br/>(FormData with file)
    API->>ImageSvc: validate_image(file)
    ImageSvc-->>API: validation result
    
    alt Invalid Image
        API-->>Frontend: 400 Bad Request
        Frontend-->>User: Show error message
    else Valid Image
        API->>ImageSvc: save_image(file)
        ImageSvc->>Storage: Save to uploads/
        Storage-->>ImageSvc: file path
        ImageSvc->>ImageSvc: Generate unique filename
        ImageSvc-->>API: {filename, path}
        API-->>Frontend: 200 OK {filename}
        Frontend->>Frontend: Store filename<br/>Create preview
    end

    Note over User,Storage: Prediction Flow
    Frontend->>API: POST /api/predict<br/>{filename, return_heatmap, threshold}
    API->>PredSvc: get_prediction_service()
    
    alt First Request (Lazy Load)
        PredSvc->>PredSvc: Initialize model
        PredSvc->>Model: Load weights from checkpoint
        Model-->>PredSvc: Model ready
    end
    
    API->>ImageSvc: load_and_preprocess(filename)
    ImageSvc->>Storage: Read image file
    Storage-->>ImageSvc: raw image data
    ImageSvc->>ImageSvc: Apply CLAHE preprocessing
    ImageSvc->>ImageSvc: Resize to 224x224
    ImageSvc->>ImageSvc: Normalize pixel values
    ImageSvc-->>API: preprocessed tensor
    
    API->>PredSvc: predict(image_tensor, return_heatmap)
    PredSvc->>Model: forward(image_tensor)
    Model->>Model: Feature extraction<br/>(CNN backbone)
    Model->>Model: Attention mechanism<br/>(MHSA/Performer)
    Model->>Model: Classification head<br/>(14 diseases)
    Model-->>PredSvc: raw logits
    
    PredSvc->>PredSvc: Apply sigmoid activation
    PredSvc->>PredSvc: Calculate probabilities
    PredSvc->>PredSvc: Filter by threshold (0.5)
    
    alt Return Heatmap Requested
        PredSvc->>Model: Generate Grad-CAM
        Model->>Model: Compute gradients
        Model->>Model: Generate activation maps
        Model-->>PredSvc: heatmap data
        PredSvc->>PredSvc: Overlay heatmap on image
    end
    
    PredSvc->>PredSvc: Assign risk levels<br/>(High/Medium/Low)
    PredSvc->>PredSvc: Get disease descriptions
    PredSvc-->>API: {predictions, heatmap, positive_findings}
    
    API-->>Frontend: 200 OK {prediction results}
    Frontend->>Frontend: Parse predictions
    Frontend->>Frontend: Display results<br/>Show disease probabilities
    Frontend->>Frontend: Render heatmap overlay
    Frontend-->>User: Show diagnosis results

    Note over User,Storage: Report Generation Flow
    User->>Frontend: Click "Download Report"
    Frontend->>API: POST /api/report<br/>{filename, predictions}
    API->>ReportSvc: generate_report(filename, predictions)
    
    ReportSvc->>ImageSvc: load_image(filename)
    ImageSvc->>Storage: Read original image
    Storage-->>ImageSvc: image data
    ImageSvc-->>ReportSvc: image
    
    ReportSvc->>ReportSvc: Create PDF document
    ReportSvc->>ReportSvc: Add header & timestamp
    ReportSvc->>ReportSvc: Add X-ray image
    ReportSvc->>ReportSvc: Add positive findings
    ReportSvc->>ReportSvc: Add complete analysis table
    ReportSvc->>ReportSvc: Add Grad-CAM heatmap
    ReportSvc->>ReportSvc: Add disclaimer
    
    ReportSvc->>Storage: Save PDF to reports/
    Storage-->>ReportSvc: PDF path
    ReportSvc-->>API: PDF file buffer
    
    API-->>Frontend: 200 OK (PDF download)
    Frontend-->>User: Download PDF report

    Note over User,Storage: Reset Flow
    User->>Frontend: Click "Reset"
    Frontend->>Frontend: Clear state<br/>(image, predictions, errors)
    Frontend-->>User: Show upload screen
